{"rank": 136, "root": "قدم", "form": 2, "lemma": "قَدَّمَ", "count": 27, "ayahCount": 27, "share": 0.14, "meaning": {"bs": "unaprijed poslati, ponuditi", "en": "to send forward, to present, to offer", "tr": "önceden göndermek, takdim etmek", "fr": "envoyer d'avance, présenter, offrir", "id": "mengirimkan lebih dahulu, mempersembahkan", "ur": "آگے بھیجنا، پیش کرنا", "bn": "আগে পাঠানো, পেশ করা, উপস্থাপন করা", "fa": "پیش فرستادن، تقدیم کردن، عرضه کردن"}, "lemmaSpoken": "audio/de408a0f1c06d6bfaf1c.m4a", "animation": "<svg class=\"va va-vqdm_2\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 72\"><style> @keyframes vqdm_2-0{from{transform:translateX(-14px)}}.va-vqdm_2 .a .ra{transform:rotate(-75deg)}.va-vqdm_2 .pl{animation:vqdm_2-0 1s ease-in-out 0.3s both}.f,.p{fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.f{stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:4.5}.t{stroke-width:8}.h{fill:var(--accent)}.p{stroke:var(--gold);stroke-width:3}.q{fill:var(--gold)}.va-vqdm_2.off,.va-vqdm_2.off *{animation:none!important}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.va-vqdm_2,.va-vqdm_2 *{animation:none!important}}</style><path class=\"p\" d=\"M6 61H114\"/><path class=\"p\" d=\"M46 44H82M50 44V61M78 44V61\"/><g class=\"a\"><g transform=\"translate(34 44)\"><g class=\"fig\"><g class=\"ll\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v17\"/></g><g class=\"rl\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v17\"/></g><g class=\"tr\"><path class=\"f t\" d=\"M0 0V-17\"/><circle class=\"h\" cy=\"-26\" r=\"6.5\"/><g transform=\"translate(0 -15)\"><g class=\"la\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v14\"/></g></g><g transform=\"translate(0 -15)\"><g class=\"ra\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v14\"/></g></g></g></g></g></g><g class=\"b\"><g transform=\"matrix(-1 0 0 1 192 0)\"><g transform=\"translate(96 44)\"><g class=\"fig\"><g class=\"ll\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v17\"/></g><g class=\"rl\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v17\"/></g><g class=\"tr\"><path class=\"f t\" d=\"M0 0V-17\"/><circle class=\"h\" cy=\"-26\" r=\"6.5\"/><g transform=\"transl